/*
  spine.spthy -- the shared base every secure_email profile uses: crypto + framework, the protocol
  (keys: init+Eve+keygen/publish/DY-fetch; mail: transport/storage/OOB), the interface (sender +
  recipient + share effects), the human layer, and the outcome-driving behaviours (compare / share /
  authorize + the degraded-click row). S0-S4 differ ONLY in the stressors they arm (+ any opt-in
  outcome rows + lemmas), which each profile lists on top of this include.
*/

